#: ../../source/reference/output-files.md:1
msgid "Output files"
msgstr "输出文件"

#: ../../source/reference/output-files.md:3
msgid "Generated file documentation."
msgstr "生成文件文档。"

#: ../../source/reference/output-files.md:5
msgid "Output directory structure"
msgstr "输出目录结构"

#: ../../source/reference/output-files.md:7
msgid ""
"The exact file set depends on whether the command converts to BF16, "
"writes compressed-tensors output, or writes a native calibrated format. "
"Copy the complete directory for every workflow."
msgstr "The exact file set depends on whether the command converts to BF16， writes compressed-tensors 输出， or writes a 原生 calibrated format。 Copy the 完整 目录 for every 工作流。"

#: ../../source/reference/output-files.md:9
msgid "Compressed-tensors output"
msgstr "compressed-tensors 输出"

#: ../../source/reference/output-files.md:11
msgid "A sharded compressed-tensors output commonly contains:"
msgstr "A 分片的 compressed-tensors 输出 commonly 包含："

#: ../../source/reference/output-files.md:28
msgid ""
"A single-file source may produce `model.safetensors` instead of the index"
" and shard files. The compressed-tensors path emits:"
msgstr "A single-file 源 may produce `model.safetensors` instead of the index and shard files。 The compressed-tensors 路径 emits："

#: ../../source/reference/output-files.md:30
msgid "`config.json` with the `quantization_config` declaration"
msgstr "带有 `quantization_config` 声明的 `config.json`"

#: ../../source/reference/output-files.md:31
msgid "the standard safetensors index and shards, or a single safetensors file"
msgstr "the 标准 safetensors index and 分片， or a single safetensors file"

#: ../../source/reference/output-files.md:32
#: ../../source/reference/output-files.md:113
msgid "`quantization_manifest.json`"
msgstr "`quantization_manifest.json`"

#: ../../source/reference/output-files.md:33
#: ../../source/reference/output-files.md:113
msgid "`quantization_report.json`"
msgstr "`quantization_report.json`"

#: ../../source/reference/output-files.md:34
msgid "tokenizer and other source support files when present"
msgstr "tokenizer and other 源 support files when present"

#: ../../source/reference/output-files.md:36
msgid ""
"When per-selector policies produce mixed W4A16/W8A8 output, `config.json`"
" uses the `mixed-precision` top-level format and declares the storage "
"format separately for each configuration group."
msgstr "When per-选择器 policies produce mixed W4A16/W8A8 输出， `config.json` 使用 the `mixed-precision` top-level format and declares the 存储 format separately for each 配置 分组。"

#: ../../source/reference/output-files.md:38
msgid ""
"`quantization_manifest.json` records quantized weights, scales, bit "
"widths, logical shapes, storage shapes, and storage formats. "
"`quantization_report.json` records processing counts, execution time, "
"requested and actual backends, CPU fallback occurrences, operation "
"events, and fallback reasons."
msgstr "`quantization_manifest.json` records quantized 权重， scales， 位 widths， 逻辑 形状， 存储 形状， and 存储 格式。 `quantization_report.json` records processing counts， execution time， requested and actual backends， CPU 回退 occurrences， operation events， and 回退 reasons。"

#: ../../source/reference/output-files.md:40
msgid "Native GPTQ and AutoRound output"
msgstr "原生 GPTQ 和 AutoRound 输出"

#: ../../source/reference/output-files.md:42
msgid ""
"Native GPTQ and native AutoRound use the GPTQ tensor ABI rather than the "
"compressed-tensors manifest contract. Their primary files are:"
msgstr "原生 GPTQ and 原生 AutoRound use the GPTQ tensor ABI rather than the compressed-tensors manifest contract。 Their primary files are："

#: ../../source/reference/output-files.md:53
msgid ""
"Depending on shard layout and exporter behavior, the native output can "
"instead contain standard native shard names and an index such as:"
msgstr "Depending on shard layout and exporter behavior， the 原生 输出 can instead contain 标准 原生 shard 名称 and an index such as："

#: ../../source/reference/output-files.md:59
msgid ""
"The native tensors include `qweight`, `qzeros`, `scales`, and `g_idx`. "
"AutoRound keeps `algorithm: autoround` provenance while using the GPTQ "
"ABI. Native GPTQ and AutoRound should not be documented as requiring "
"`quantization_manifest.json` or `quantization_report.json` unless a "
"specific exporter independently emits those files."
msgstr "The 原生 tensors 包含 `qweight`， `qzeros`， `scales`， and `g_idx`。 AutoRound keeps `algorithm： autoround` 来源 while using the GPTQ ABI。 原生 GPTQ and AutoRound should not be documented as requiring `quantization_manifest.json` or `quantization_report.json` unless a specific exporter 独立 emits those files。"

#: ../../source/reference/output-files.md:61
msgid "Native AWQ output"
msgstr "原生 AWQ 输出"

#: ../../source/reference/output-files.md:63
msgid "Native AWQ GEMM output primarily contains:"
msgstr "原生 AWQ GEMM 输出 primarily 包含："

#: ../../source/reference/output-files.md:74
msgid ""
"The native tensors include `qweight`, `qzeros`, and `scales`. Native AWQ "
"uses `quant_config.json`, not `quantize_config.json`. Native AWQ should "
"not be documented as requiring the compressed-tensors manifest or "
"execution report."
msgstr "The 原生 tensors 包含 `qweight`， `qzeros`， and `scales`。 原生 AWQ 使用 `quant_config.json`， not `quantize_config.json`。 原生 AWQ should not be documented as requiring the compressed-tensors manifest or execution report。"

#: ../../source/reference/output-files.md:76
msgid "Core files"
msgstr "核心文件"

#: ../../source/reference/output-files.md:78
msgid "config.json"
msgstr "config.json"

#: ../../source/reference/output-files.md:80
msgid ""
"Model configuration and, for supported formats, the runtime quantization "
"declaration. A compressed-tensors example is:"
msgstr "Model 配置 and， for supported 格式， the 运行时 量化 declaration。 A compressed-tensors 示例 is："

#: ../../source/reference/output-files.md:91
msgid ""
"Native GPTQ, AutoRound, and AWQ configurations use the method-specific "
"metadata expected by the target loader."
msgstr "原生 GPTQ， AutoRound， and AWQ configurations use the 方法-specific 元数据 expected by the 目标 loader。"

#: ../../source/reference/output-files.md:93
msgid "model.safetensors.index.json"
msgstr "model.safetensors.index.json"

#: ../../source/reference/output-files.md:95
msgid ""
"The weight shard index. Every tensor referenced by the index must exist "
"in one of the referenced shard files."
msgstr "The 权重 shard index。 Every tensor referenced by the index 必须 exist in one of the referenced shard files。"

#: ../../source/reference/output-files.md:97
msgid "model-*.safetensors"
msgstr "model-*.safetensors"

#: ../../source/reference/output-files.md:99
msgid ""
"Standard model weight shards used by the indexed compressed-tensors and "
"conversion paths when emitted with that naming convention."
msgstr "标准 model 权重 分片 used by the 带索引的 compressed-tensors and 转换 paths when emitted with that naming convention。"

#: ../../source/reference/output-files.md:101
msgid "model.safetensors"
msgstr "model.safetensors"

#: ../../source/reference/output-files.md:103
msgid ""
"A single-file safetensors weight file used instead of an index and shard "
"set when the output is not sharded."
msgstr "A single-file safetensors 权重 file used instead of an index and shard set when the 输出 is not 分片的。"

#: ../../source/reference/output-files.md:105
msgid "Conversion-specific files"
msgstr "转换专用文件"

#: ../../source/reference/output-files.md:107
msgid "conversion_report.json"
msgstr "conversion_report.json"

#: ../../source/reference/output-files.md:109
msgid ""
"BF16 conversion output can include `conversion_report.json`, which "
"records conversion statistics, recognized source formats, processing "
"time, requested and actual backends, and fallback events when reported by"
" the conversion path."
msgstr "BF16 转换 输出 can 包含 `conversion_report.json`， which records 转换 statistics， 已识别的 源 格式， processing time， requested and actual backends， and 回退 events when reported by the 转换 路径。"

#: ../../source/reference/output-files.md:111
msgid "Publishing requirements"
msgstr "发布要求"

#: ../../source/reference/output-files.md:114
msgid ""
"Copy the entire output directory rather than only `.safetensors` files. "
"Preserve configuration, index or single-file weights, method metadata, "
"quantization metadata, and supporting tokenizer files when they are "
"present."
msgstr "Copy the entire 输出 目录 rather than 仅 `.safetensors` files。 Preserve 配置， index or single-file 权重， 方法 元数据， 量化 元数据， and supporting tokenizer files when they are present。"

#: ../../source/reference/output-files.md:117
msgid "For compressed-tensors output, preserve:"
msgstr "For compressed-tensors 输出， preserve："

#: ../../source/reference/output-files.md:128
msgid ""
"For native GPTQ or AutoRound, preserve `config.json`, "
"`quantize_config.json`, the native index or single-file weights, native "
"shards, and tokenizer files when present. For native AWQ, preserve "
"`config.json`, `quant_config.json`, native weights, and tokenizer files "
"when present. For BF16 conversion, preserve `conversion_report.json` when"
" emitted."
msgstr "For 原生 GPTQ or AutoRound， preserve `config.json`， `quantize_config.json`， the 原生 index or single-file 权重， 原生 分片， and tokenizer files when present。 For 原生 AWQ， preserve `config.json`， `quant_config.json`， 原生 权重， and tokenizer files when present。 For BF16 转换， preserve `conversion_report.json` when emitted。"

